  "translation": "Na em i tokim meri bilong en: Bilong wanem, mi toktok long Nabot, man bilong Yizreel, na mi tokim em: Givim ⟨את⟩ gaden wain bilong yu long mi bilong silva, o sapos yu laikem, bai mi givim yu wanpela gaden wain long ples bilong em. Na em i tok: Mi no givim yu ⟨את⟩ gaden wain bilong mi.",
